            L: {
              item: "lectern",
              props: {
                title: "Decon Protocol 7",
                text: "Leave your coat and your name at the door.\n\nThe east door of the concourse answers to a red keycard. The director kept hers in her suite, north of here, past Records. The holes in the concourse floor are old drain shafts. Nobody has ever reported how deep they go.",
              },
            },
            u: {
              item: "lectern",
              props: {
                title: "Records Memo 33",
                text: "Whoever finishes the audit: do not lift the director's keycard while the vents are open.\n\nWe tested it. The vents notice the weight of the key. They notice, and then they open.",
              },
            },
            Q: {
              item: "lectern",
              props: {
                title: "The Director's Last Entry",
                text: "I put the gold card in cold storage, under the first subjects, where it would be safe. They were the only ones who would never be hungry.\n\nPast the red door the core hall has a tripwire down its middle. The dart plates fire along the aisles. Cross them sideways.",
              },
            },
            N: {
              item: "lectern",
              props: {
                title: "Rack Maintenance Log",
                text: "Rack 9 sparks in the wet. Rack 14 sparks in the dry.\n\nThe plates in the aisles are wired to the walls. The laser at the centre is wired to the vents behind the racks. Nobody wired the gold door. It only wants its card.",
              },
            },
            P: {
              item: "lectern",
              props: {
                title: "Cryo Log, Final Page",
                text: "Pod 3 is empty. Pod 4 is empty. I have left the gold card on the shelf and I am writing this with my back against the door.\n\nThe pods have been warming for an hour. Whatever is inside does not need a card.",
              },
            },
